    "because": "optimisticupdatenode.ts header: \"if the key no longer holds the value this update applied, the update is superseded. Its patch is closed without restoring, the newer value stands, and error says so\"; `key`: \"an Apply with no key is refused rather than dropped\"; `failure`: \"no Key, a transaction id already open, or no such update to resolve\"",
